<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 3. As it is unlikely that you will quickly be able to assemble the full set, simming yourself is advised in order to optimize after taking into account the gear you get each raiding week.<br/>
<br/>The talents listed on the planner are for <b>single-target</b>, but you can consult the talent page for a suggestion on how to adapt to multi-target scenarios.<br/>
