<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Elemental Shamans in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our Phase 3 set has relatively weak bonuses, but since they come for free on gear with good stats, we will want to be using them as soon as we can, regardless. The 2-set can be quite decent but will not scale particularly well with your new gear due to being a flat effect, while the 4-set provides cooldown reduction for <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=114049/ascendance">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/classic_spell_fire_elementaldevastation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ascendance</span></a>, but only in single target situations where you are using <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=51505/lava-burst">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_lavaburst.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lava Burst</span></a> often.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 15 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1170/regalia-of-the-witch-doctor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Witch Doctor</span></a></span></h3>
