<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Elemental Shaman Trinkets in Phase 3</span></h2>There are only multiple good trinkets that come from raiding, but as it can be hard to get your hands into those, we will also list some older or alternative sourced trinkets.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96455/breath-of-the-hydra">
<img alt="Breath of the Hydra" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_mindflay.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breath of the Hydra</span></a> is one of the two best trinkets for Elemental, sporting solid stats and a proc that can be used alongside other cooldowns for great effect.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96413/wushoolays-final-choice">
<img alt="Wushoolay's Final Choice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_chainlightning.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wushoolay's Final Choice</span></a> is the other best trinket, with a similar but slower to ramp up Intellect proc to use alongside cooldowns.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96516/cha-yes-essence-of-brilliance">
<img alt="Cha-Ye's Essence of Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_mindsooth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cha-Ye's Essence of Brilliance</span></a> is unfortunately high on Critical Strike, which is not as good as the other stat alternatives, but you should be able to activate this often with your guaranteed Criticals from <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=51505/lava-burst">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shaman_lavaburst.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lava Burst</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96558/unerring-vision-of-lei-shen">
<img alt="Unerring Vision of Lei Shen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unerring Vision of Lei Shen</span></a> can be fantastic in area of effect situations but the timing for it is very precise and due to your guaranteed Critical Strikes, its procs are wasted if you happen to be casting Lava Bursts when it procs.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94510/volatile-talisman-of-the-shado-pan-assault">
